.TH swarm-discover-relays 1  "swarm 0.2.2" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-discover\-relays \- Find public relay servers through the Mainline DHT and relay gossip
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm discover\-relays\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find public relay servers through the Mainline DHT and relay gossip
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print a JSON object containing protocol\-verified public relays
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
